    "title": "Expanded IMSA VP Racing SportsCar Challenge 2026 Schedule Revealed - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago DAYTONA BEACH, Fla. –The IMSA VP Racing SportsCar Challenge will expand from six to 10 total race weekends in 2026, covering both sprint and endurance racing formats. The series will continue to run two 45-minute races on sprint weekends, while the four new weekends will include a two-hour endurance race component for Le Mans Prototype 3 (LMP3) cars. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
